12
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:42,100
This is a very important skill because sometimes work can be confusing, stressful, or difficult.

13
00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:46,930
And when that happens, you need to know how to ask for help politely and professionally.

14
00:00:47,410 --> 00:00:47,950
Exactly.

15
00:00:48,450 --> 00:00:51,760
Many English learners feel nervous when speaking to their boss.

16
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:55,920
They worry about sounding rude, weak, or unprofessional.

17
00:00:56,010 --> 00:01:00,010
But the truth is, asking for help is completely normal in the workplace.

18
00:01:00,530 --> 00:01:06,980
Good managers usually appreciate employees who communicate honestly instead of pretending they understand everything.

19
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:08,600
That's such a good point.

20
00:01:09,110 --> 00:01:13,550
Asking for help the right way can actually make you look responsible and professional.

21
00:01:13,970 --> 00:01:23,670
